'' ===========================================================================
''
''   File.......  ch02-light-a-child.spin2
''   Purpose....  A parent turning on a child's debug channel where it
''                declares the object
''   Manual.....  P2 Diagnostics Handbook
''   Version....  v0.1.0 (2026-10-13)
''   Appears in.  Chapter 2: Staying Inside the Debug Limits -- 2.6
''                Compiling less
''   Authors....  Iron Sheep Productions, LLC
''   E-mail.....  stephen@ironsheep.biz
''   Started....  Oct 2026
''   Updated....  Oct 2026
''
''   This file is an EXAMPLE from the manual above. Everything below
''   this header is byte-identical to the listing printed there --
''   what you read in the manual is what builds here.
''
'' ===========================================================================

CON
  _clkfreq = 200_000_000

OBJ
  sensor : "ch02-sensor-driver" | DEBUG_MASK = %1   ' channel 0 on

PUB main() | reading
  reading := sensor.sample(21)
  debug(udec(reading))

